{% set names = ref('issue_tree.branches[*].name') %}
Does the recommendation follow from the branch verdicts? For example, a "go"
with a refuted economics branch, or a "no-go" with every branch supported,
should fail.

Branch verdicts:
{% for t in ref('branch') %}{% set name = names[loop.index0] %}
